ares_tihoso.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/95?cb=20191120030927 \"Anactorprepares tihoso.jpg (1.04 MB","line":119},{"title":"![Script Excerpt - The Ersatz Elevator","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/0/08/Teescriptexcerpt_tihoso.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191029235517 \"Teescriptexcerpt tihoso.PNG (249 KB","line":123},{"title":"The Ersatz Elevator","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/The_Ersatz_Elevator \"The Ersatz Elevator\"","line":125},{"title":"![Script Excerpt - The Slippery Slope: Part One","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/f/fc/Tssscriptexcerpt_tihoso.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/147?cb=20191029235534 \"Tssscriptexcerpt tihoso.PNG (515 KB","line":127},{"title":"The Slippery Slope: Part One","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/The_Slippery_Slope:_Pa***REMOVED***One \"The Slippery Slope: Part One\"","line":129},{"title":"![Count Olaf's Acting Troupe.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/a/a0/Actingtroupe_tihoso.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191029222457 \"Actingtroupe tihoso.jpg (477 KB","line":131},{"title":"![Henchperson of Indeterminate Gender.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/9/92/Henchperson_tihoso.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/135?cb=20191029222725 \"Henchperson tihoso.jpg (700 KB","line":135},{"title":"![Fernald's Resume.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/d/d9/Fernaldresume.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20191029235606 \"Fernaldresume.PNG (1.09 MB","line":139},{"title":"![Fernald.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/8/86/Fernald_tihoso.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/119?cb=20191029222542 \"Fernald tihoso.jpg (704 KB","line":143},{"title":"![White-Faced Women.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/1/14/Whitefacedwoman_tihoso.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/104?cb=201910292